  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Spell. For 5...9...10 seconds, your undead allies gain +10 Health regeneration. All conditions are removed from those allies and transferred to you. If this spell is successful and you have control of 3 or fewer minions, Verata's Sacrifice instantly recharges.",
      "zhTW": "犧牲自己最大體力的 15% 。持續 5～10 秒，使我方所有的不死爪牙獲得體力再生 +10 。所有這些不死爪牙遭受的「病症」移轉到你身上。若施展魔法成功而且帶領的不死爪牙在 3 隻以下，芙瑞達的犧牲這技能將立即回復。"
    },
